{{!< default}}
{{!-- WHS Brief: custom route (not a collection) rendering only #brief-tagged
posts via {{#get}}. Posts still get the site's normal /{slug}/ permalink
(from the unfiltered "/" collection in routes.yaml) — this page is purely a
filtered browsing view, not a permalink prefix. See routes.yaml.

Paying members (@member.paid) skip the generic masthead/Subscribe banner
entirely and see the current week's full brief embedded directly at the
top instead, with older weeks still listed as cards below (the current
week is excluded from that list so it isn't shown twice). Anonymous/free
visitors keep the original masthead + Subscribe CTA + full card list
exactly as before, current week included as Ghost's normal locked card —
that banner is still the primary conversion path for new subscribers, so
it's deliberately left untouched for them. --}}

<main id="site-main" class="site-main outer">
<div class="inner posts">

    {{#unless @member.paid}}
    <div class="whs-brief-doc">
        <div class="wbd-masthead">
            <p class="wbd-eyebrow">Work Health &amp; Safety — Weekly Legislative Brief</p>
            <h1>WHS &amp; OHS legislative changes across Australia</h1>
            <p class="wbd-dek">Amendments, commencements and proposals moving through Commonwealth, state and territory work health &amp; safety law — plus New Zealand developments, relevant Australian Standards, and notable WHS court decisions.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="whs-brief-intro">
            <p>Every week: full detail across all nine Australian jurisdictions, New Zealand developments, curated Australian Standards releases, and notable WHS court decisions — each item sourced and linked back to the regulator, court record or legal publisher it came from.</p>
            <div class="wbd-subscribe-col">
                <a class="gh-head-button" href="#/portal/signup" data-portal="signup">{{t "Subscribe"}}</a>
                <p class="wbd-invoice-note">Pay by invoice? <a href="mailto:info@whsbrief.com?subject=Pay%20by%20invoice%20%E2%80%94%20WHS%20Brief%20subscription">Contact us</a></p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
    {{/unless}}

    {{#get "posts" filter="tag:brief" limit="all" include="tags,authors" as |posts|}}

        {{#if @member.paid}}
            {{#with posts.[0]}}
                <article class="whs-brief-current">
                    {{content}}
                </article>
            {{/with}}
        {{/if}}

        <div class="post-feed">
            {{#foreach posts}}
                {{#if @first}}
                    {{#unless @member.paid}}
                        {{> "post-card"}}
                    {{/unless}}
                {{else}}
                    {{> "post-card"}}
                {{/if}}
            {{else}}
                <p class="none">No posts yet.</p>
            {{/foreach}}
        </div>

    {{/get}}

</div>
</main>
